  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ピオニーが　おとした　ふしぎなメモ。\nマックスダイすあなに　ひかる　あなが\nひらかれた　しゃしんが　はりつけてある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "피오니가 떨어뜨린 수상한 메모.\n맥스다이맥스굴에 빛나는 구멍이 열린\n사진이 붙어 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "皮歐尼掉落的神秘筆記。\n上面貼的照片裡可以看見\n極巨巢穴有個發光的大洞。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une note mystérieuse que Dhilan a égarée.\nOn peut y voir la photo d’un trou de lumière,\ndans le Grand Antre Dynamax.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine rätselhafte Notiz, die Peony verloren hat.\nDarin klebt ein Foto eines leuchtenden Lochs,\ndas sich über dem Dyna-Riesennest geöffnet hat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una extraña nota que se le cayó a Peony. Tiene pegada\nuna foto del Supernido Dinamax en la que se ve una\ncavidad luminosa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Appunti misteriosi perduti da Peony.\nVi è incollata una foto di uno squarcio luminoso\napertosi in una dynatana max.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mysterious clue that Peony seems to have dropped.\nThere’s a photo attached to it showing a shining hole\nopening above the Max Lair.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ピオニーが　落とした　不思議なメモ。\nマックスダイ巣穴に　光の穴が\n開かれた　写真が　貼り付けてある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "皮欧尼掉落的神秘笔记。\n上面贴有极巨巢穴\n出现光洞的照片。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una extraña nota que se le cayó a Peony. Tiene pegada\nuna foto del Supernido Dinamax en la que se ve una\ncavidad luminosa.",
      "version_group": {
